From: PANP2010 <18610364979@163.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 00:47:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?nebula:=20D2-bucket=20=E2=80=94=20wire=20Bucket?=
 =?UTF-8?q?DagBuilder=20+=20entity-pos=20spatial=20bucketing?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- NebulaBucketIntegration: process-wide BucketDagBuilder singleton
- ServerLevel.nebula$tickViaDAG: pass bucket builder to TickPipeline
- EntityTaskBuilder.classifyRWSet: declare readBlock(entityPos) so entity
  tasks get bucketed by §6.3 "current position" affinity rather than
  falling into GLOBAL_BUCKET

Stress smoke (250 mobs in one region, 30s wall):
  before: 84 ticks, avg-ms/tick=357 (DagBuilder O(N²) only)
  bucket-only-naive: 19 ticks, avg-ms/tick=1606 (bucket overhead +
    GLOBAL_BUCKET fallthrough — strictly worse)
  bucket + entity readBlock(pos): 230 ticks, avg-ms/tick=130 — best
    result in the session, peak-ms 152.

Why entity-pos read is correct (arch §3.2 + §6.3):
  - vanilla entity tick reads the standing-on block (gravity, fluids)
  - readBlock conflicts with block writes at same pos — that's a true
    RAW dependency that should be in the DAG
  - SpatialBucketIndex now assigns entity tasks to the same bucket as
    nearby block tasks, enabling per-bucket O(K²) scans instead of one
    global O(N²) scan

diff --git a/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/EntityTaskBuilder.java b/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/EntityTaskBuilder.java
index 010d97ac578eb7aeda9a7c0abf82ff90a0f93d05..623e32f20f1e86da9825591600d2958f5a561dbe 100644
--- a/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/EntityTaskBuilder.java
+++ b/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/EntityTaskBuilder.java
@@ -116,8 +116,18 @@ public final class EntityTaskBuilder {
         if (entity instanceof ServerPlayer) {
             return GLOBAL_RW;
         }
+        // Per §6.3: entity bucket affinity is determined by its current position.
+        // Declaring readBlock(entityPos) lets SpatialBucketIndex assign entity
+        // tasks to the same bucket as nearby block tasks, enabling O(N×K) DAG
+        // construction. The block read is also semantically correct — vanilla
+        // entity tick reads the standing-on block (gravity, fluid checks).
+        org.nebula.core.state.WorldPos pos = new org.nebula.core.state.WorldPos(
+            entity.level().dimension().identifier().hashCode(),
+            entity.getBlockX(), entity.getBlockY(), entity.getBlockZ()
+        );
         return RWSet.builder()
             .writeEntity(new EntityField(entityId, "*"))
+            .readBlock(pos)
             .build();
     }
 
diff --git a/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/NebulaBucketIntegration.java b/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/NebulaBucketIntegration.java
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..52d5f5c3bab8ecc92454c777eb990de3cbabed9a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/NebulaBucketIntegration.java
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+package io.papermc.paper.threadedregions;
+
+import org.nebula.core.bucket.BucketDagBuilder;
+
+/**
+ * Adapter that exposes a process-wide {@link BucketDagBuilder} singleton to the
+ * Nebula tick path (architecture §4.1-§4.3).
+ *
+ * <p>One {@code BucketDagBuilder} instance is reused across all ticks because:
+ * <ul>
+ *   <li>It is stateless apart from the {@code SccContractor} and the shared
+ *       {@code ForkJoinPool.commonPool()} reference.</li>
+ *   <li>Allocating one per tick would churn the GC for no benefit.</li>
+ * </ul>
+ *
+ * <p>Pass the builder into {@link org.nebula.core.scheduler.TickPipeline}'s
+ * full constructor so the production tick path uses spatial bucketing
+ * instead of the O(N²) {@code DagBuilder} fallback.
+ */
+public final class NebulaBucketIntegration {
+
+    private static final BucketDagBuilder INSTANCE = new BucketDagBuilder();
+
+    private NebulaBucketIntegration() {}
+
+    public static BucketDagBuilder builder() {
+        return INSTANCE;
+    }
+}
diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
index a5ea6e68faf29a3ea1ddef512ac4d49526e25b53..5a3efb36846762042689f67ae428380322beb876 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
@@ -3264,7 +3264,8 @@ public class ServerLevel extends Level implements WorldGenLevel, ServerEntityGet
                 io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.NebulaGuardIntegration.runner(tick)
             );
         org.nebula.core.scheduler.TickPipeline pipeline = new org.nebula.core.scheduler.TickPipeline(
-            microStepGenerator, runner, 256
+            microStepGenerator, runner, 256, null,
+            io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.NebulaBucketIntegration.builder()
         );
 
         try {
